From 6592dcc9b0bc7280185c521a0fdaf042d70813e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:53:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ChopGimp 3.28.1: Live Paint (Vecteur > Peinture dynamique:
 regions and path segments of the selected objects colored separately without
 boolean operations, recomputed when a path moves, gap closing, expand,
 release; Live Paint Bucket tool K, Live Paint Selection tool Shift+K) and
 Symbols (image-level definitions, occurrences as groups following every edit,
 Symboles panel, place, edit, break link, rename, delete); PDB livepaint-* /
 symbol-* commands

