+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * Copyright (C) 1995 Spencer Kimball and Peter Mattis
+ *
+ * chopgimp-livepainttool.c — ChopGimp 3.28.1 (lot V6 point 6): the
+ * « Pot de peinture dynamique » (K) and « Sélection de peinture
+ * dynamique » (Maj+K) tools of Illustrator, on the live paint groups of
+ * the vector layers (path/chopgimp-vlivepaint.h).
+ *
+ *  - Pot: the region under the pointer is outlined in red; a click fills
+ *    it with the foreground color, Maj+clic strokes the segment under
+ *    the pointer, Alt+clic takes the color of the region (pipette);
+ *  - Sélection: a click selects a region (or a segment near the
+ *    pointer), Maj+clic adds or removes it; the Aspect panel and the
+ *    buttons of the tool options then change their fill or stroke.
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
+ * it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
+ * the Free Software Foundation; either version 3 of the License, or
+ * (at your option) any later version.
+ */
+
